    "normalSizeEvidence": "Both original138CSS and support90CSS stages were inspected raw/codec on light/dark. Each shared transparent-only crop is drawn at its recorded full-stage origin, preserving the cohort's scale. Own live60neutral\u219218look\u219212neutral@30Hz verifies pose60\u201377, exact return78 and terminal89 held through3000ms without page errors. Head/bill changes are genuinely drawn attention changes, not runtime bobbing. Both cohorts are reviewed independently; their different world calibration is not silently mixed.",
